  3. On `createUser` error where the email already exists (`error.status === 422` / message includes `'already'`) — surface a clear `ConflictException('Já existe uma conta com este e-mail')` rather than silently proceeding (today's flow only checked the `motoboys` table for dupes; now must also account for an `auth.users` collision with an email belonging to e.g. a customer or another restaurant's motoboy).
